    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your opponent in this turn-based card battler! Master the unique time frame mechanic - calculate when to take some risks, and exploit your opponent's hasty decisions. Explore a range of playable fighters, each of whom has their own move set, and many come with unique mechanics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>Stage Fighting</strong>, a popular activity enjoyed by many from various backgrounds across this fictional Empire. For their own reasons, the fighters found themselves in this major city under the Empire's ruling. They came from a variety of professions and experiences - peacekeepers, actors, builders, and many more.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.poster.avif?t=1754840655\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.webm?t=1754840655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/7a0375187c3eab249f71508b5f200cf5.mp4?t=1754840655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LITE version features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New player guidance with Assistant<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831600/extras/1b3154d5da39fb1e1022bcdf9c29b4fc.avif?t=1754840655\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play with/against 3 fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add some house rules </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against Assistant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against other LITE version players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain resources to unlock new content, carried forward to FULL version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In sync with all quality of life improvements in FULL version </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL version features (on top of LITE version)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play with/against a total of 12 fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against other FULL version players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck support</p></li></ul>",
